### 2. IInteractionPromptProvider Interface and Prompt Display

**Interface + Struct:**
**File:** `C:\Users\DriveSIM\Documents\GitHub\unity_dev_space\Assets\Flynn\Scripts\Player\InteractionPrompt.cs`

